SUMMARY:Tea Dance Presented by AJ Rourk
DESCRIPTION:🌈 Friday Tea Dance at Porta 🪩 \nJoin DJ Cher La Luna and Carl Michaels on Friday\, 5/22 from 4-9pm for a night of disco\, house\, queer classics\, and gay pop favorites inspired by the spirit of legendary tea dances and LGBTQ+ nightlife culture. \nTea dances have long served as spaces for community\, celebration\, connection\, and freedom on the dancefloor. This event brings that energy to Montclair with an inclusive\, high-vibe evening built around music\, joy\, and chosen family. \nDJ Cher La Luna is known throughout the NJ/NYC area for soulful\, eclectic sets that blend disco\, world grooves\, house\, funk\, and deep cuts with an emphasis on connection and community. A longtime creative and nightlife curator\, she has built a following through events that feel equal parts dance party and gathering space. \nCarl Michaels has spent decades shaping nightlife culture\, from the rave scene and 611 Records to Philly gay clubs\, Fire Island tea dances\, Pride stages\, and arena shows opening for artists including Carly Rae Jepsen and Kim Petras. He also serves as board president of DVLF. \nExpect disco anthems\, soulful house\, singalongs\, dancing\, and a welcoming crowd where everybody belongs. 🌈 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/tea-dance-presented-by-aj-rourk/2026-07-17/
LOCATION:Porta Montclair\, 499 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_8118.png
END:VEVENT
