SUMMARY:Deivito's Last Church Street Show!
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss Deivito’s last official Church Street Show! \nYes – Deivito (also known as the guy in the cowboy hat that’s been busking in Spanglish on Montclair’s Church Street for over 20 years) is moving away at the end of July. If you know him\, or don’t\, come by and enjoy his music as he bids adieu to his favorite promenade! \nSuggested Door $3 (support our far and few independent music venues!) \nTiny Montclair Music\n51 Church St.. Montclair NJ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
