SUMMARY:Book Signing Event with Linda Perillo\, Author of Your Payment Method Has Been Declined
DESCRIPTION:Author\, Radio Host\, Travel Expert and Mom of 8\, Linda Perillo\, will be at Barnes & Noble Clark Commons signing copies of her memoir Your Payment Method Has Been Declined\, which dives into her life growing up in a family travel dynasty\, her motherhood journey\, and the ugly side of complex trust arrangements that left her broke at 52\, forcing her to rebuild her life in the midst of divorce\, kidney cancer and more life-altering obstacles. Her story is one of resilience and reinvention at any age. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
