SUMMARY:Cohome's Summer Friendraiser at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join Cohome’s Friendraiser in support of inclusive housing from 7pm-9pm.\nCohome’s mission is to create inclusive\, community-based housing where adults of all abilities live together as peers\, fostering independence\, belonging\, and authentic relationships. Through its innovative co-living model\, Cohome aims to challenge traditional systems and expand opportunities for people with disabilities to live full\, connected lives in a true home environment. \nSign up for the event here! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
